(868, 'Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Overview of Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord: The Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly is a robust and efficient solution for maintaining optimal belt and chain tension in heavy-duty industrial applications. Additionally, the clearance seal provides protection against contaminants, enhancing durability and performance. Built for demanding environments, this take-up assembly helps maximize system efficiency and reliability. Specs: Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT Locking Device Kit: SC3207.', 'The Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly is a robust and efficient solution for maintaining optimal belt and chain tension in heavy-duty industrial applications. It features a 2 7/16\" mounted spherical roller bearing with a center pull, side-mounted design, allowing for easy installation and precise adjustment. The eccentric cam locking collar ensures a secure, self-tightening grip on the shaft, reducing the risk of slippage. Additionally, the clearance seal provides protection against contaminants, enhancing durability and performance. Built for demanding environments, this take-up assembly helps maximize system efficiency and reliability.', 'The Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly is a robust and efficient solution for maintaining optimal belt and chain tension in heavy-duty industrial applications.', 'The Rexnord ZAT8320712 Take-up Assembly is a robust and efficient solution for maintaining optimal belt and chain tension in heavy-duty industrial applications.', 'Model: ZAT3000\nHousing Material: Cast Iron\nHousing Style: Take-Up Assembly\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nBore Diameter: 2.4375 in\nCage Material: Engineered Polymer', 'Model: ZAT3000\nHousing Material: Cast Iron\nHousing Style: Take-Up Assembly\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nBore Diameter: 2.4375 in\nCage Material: Engineered Polymer', 'Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT\nLocking Device Kit: SC3207\nEnd Cap: DTC812\nMaximum Speed: 3300 rpm\nNet Weight Kg: 52 lbs\nSize Code: 8', 'Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT\nLocking Device Kit: SC3207\nEnd Cap: DTC812\nMaximum Speed: 3300 rpm\nNet Weight Kg: 52 lbs\nSize Code: 8', 0, 0, 81, 740, 28, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/Rexnord_ZAT8320712_Take-up_Assembly_-_Rexnord.jpg', '2026-01-21 08:31:30', '2026-01-21 08:31:30'),
(870, 'Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Overview of Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord: The Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly is a high-performance solution designed for precise belt and chain tensioning in industrial applications. Additionally, the assembly includes a 1/8 NPT grease fitting, allowing for easy maintenance and extended bearing life. Ideal for heavy-duty environments, this Rexnord take-up assembly enhances system efficiency and reliability. Specs: Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT Locking Device Kit: SC4.', 'The Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly is a high-performance solution designed for precise belt and chain tensioning in industrial applications. Featuring a 1 1/2\" mounted spherical roller bearing, this center pull, side-mounted take-up assembly ensures smooth operation and durability. It comes equipped with a single setscrew locking collar for secure shaft attachment and a clearance seal to protect against contaminants. Additionally, the assembly includes a 1/8 NPT grease fitting, allowing for easy maintenance and extended bearing life. Ideal for heavy-duty environments, this Rexnord take-up assembly enhances system efficiency and reliability.', 'The Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly is a high-performance solution designed for precise belt and chain tensioning in industrial applications. Featuring a 1 1/2\" mounted spherical roller bearing, this center pull, side-mounted take-up assembly ensures smooth operation and durability.', 'The Rexnord ZAT421089 Take-up Assembly is a high-performance solution designed for precise belt and chain tensioning in industrial applications. Featuring a 1 1/2\" mounted spherical roller bearing, this center pull, side-mounted take-up assembly ensures smooth operation and durability.', 'Model: ZAT2000\nHousing Material: Cast Iron\nHousing Style: Take-Up Assembly\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nBore Diameter: 1.5 in\nCage Material: Engineere