(900, 'C71 Bando Classical V-Belt - Bando', 'C71 Bando Classical V-Belt - Bando', 'Overview of C71 Bando Classical V-Belt - Bando: C71 Classical V-Belt is still the most practical, economical and dependable belt for most industrial drives. Bando\'s constant improvements in materials, design and manufacturing methods help Power King keep pace with industry\'s ever increasing demands for long, trouble-free belt service. Specs: Length In: 71 Width In: 0.88.', 'C71 Classical V-Belt is still the most practical, economical and dependable belt for most industrial drives. Innovations have failed to displace the need for classical section belts. Bando\'s constant improvements in materials, design and manufacturing methods help Power King keep pace with industry\'s ever increasing demands for long, trouble-free belt service.', 'C71 Classical V-Belt is still the most practical, economical and dependable belt for most industrial drives. Innovations have failed to displace the need for classical section belts.', 'C71 Classical V-Belt is still the most practical, economical and dependable belt for most industrial drives. Innovations have failed to displace the need for classical section belts.', 'Height Mm: 13.5\nColor: Black\nWidth Mm: 22.4\nWeight Lbs: 1.349\nSection: C', 'Height Mm: 13.5\nColor: Black\nWidth Mm: 22.4\nWeight Lbs: 1.349\nSection: C', 'Length In: 71\nWidth In: 0.88\nHeight In: 0.53\nLength Mm: 1905', 'Length In: 71\nWidth In: 0.88\nHeight In: 0.53\nLength Mm: 1905', 0, 0, 83, 924, 31, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/C71_Bando_Classical_V-Belt_-_Bando.png', '2026-01-21 09:02:48', '2026-01-21 09:02:48'),
