(1384, '4B61 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', '4B61 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', 'Overview of 4B61 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ: 4/B61 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt. The tie bands feature tensile cords running in the transverse direction across the top of the belts providing extreme strength to the finished banded belt. Specs: Number Of Ribs: 4 Length In: 61.', '4/B61 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt. The tie bands are made of heavy-duty, directionally woven fabric and then encapsulated in tough rubber casing to give excellent flexibility around the pulleys. The tie bands feature tensile cords running in the transverse direction across the top of the belts providing extreme strength to the finished banded belt.', '4/B61 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt.', '4/B61 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt.', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․55\'\'\nSpacing: .75\'\'\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․55\'\'\nSpacing: .75\'\'\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Number Of Ribs: 4\nLength In: 61\nSection: B', 'Number Of Ribs: 4\nLength In: 61\nSection: B', 0, 0, 83, 925, 30, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/4B61_Classical_Combo_V_belts_-_BESTORQ.jpg', '2026-01-21 09:29:37', '2026-01-21 0