(1911, '2BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', '2BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', 'Overview of 2BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ: 2/BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V-belts are constructed of the same highly engineered, high performance components as classical belts but their aramid tensile cords are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch. The outer fabric wrap is treated oil and heat resistant, engineered synthetic rubber compound, intended for high wear resistance. They are manufactured to meet RMA standards for length and dimensions. Specs: Length In: 145 Number Of Ribs: 2.', '2/BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V-belts are constructed of the same highly engineered, high performance components as classical belts but their aramid tensile cords are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch. The outer fabric wrap is treated oil and heat resistant, engineered synthetic rubber compound, intended for high wear resistance. These V-belts are recommended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. They are manufactured to meet RMA standards for length and dimensions.', '2/BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V-belts are constructed of the same highly engineered, high performance components as classical belts but their aramid tensile cords are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch.', '2/BK145 Aramid Classical Combo V-belts are constructed of the same highly engineered, high performance components as classical belts but their aramid tensile cords are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch.', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․55\'\'\nSpacing: .75\'\'\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․55\'\'\nSpacing: .75\'\'\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Length In: 145\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: BK', 'Length In: 145\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: BK', 0, 0, 83, 925, 30, 1,