(1942, '2C144 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', '2C144 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ', 'Overview of 2C144 Classical Combo V belts - BESTORQ: 2/C144 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt. The tie bands feature tensile cords running in the transverse direction across the top of the belts providing extreme strength to the finished banded belt. Specs: Width In: 0.88 Length In: 144.', '2/C144 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt. The tie bands are made of heavy-duty, directionally woven fabric and then encapsulated in tough rubber casing to give excellent flexibility around the pulleys. The tie bands feature tensile cords running in the transverse direction across the top of the belts providing extreme strength to the finished banded belt.', '2/C144 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt.', '2/C144 Classical Combo V-belts are intended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are bound together with a fabric tie band specifically created to have superb adhesion to each individual belt.', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․74\'\'\nSpacing: 1.00\'\'\nCross Section: C', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․74\'\'\nSpacing: 1.00\'\'\nCross Section: C', 'Width In: 0.88\nLength In: 144\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: C', 'Width In: 0.88\nLength In: 144\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: C', 0, 0, 83, 925, 30, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/2C144_Classical_Combo_V_belts_-_BEST