(2021, '3 B66 Classical Combo V Belt - Optibelt', '3 B66 Classical Combo V Belt - Optibelt', 'Overview of 3 B66 Classical Combo V Belt - Optibelt: Optibelt 3/B66 KB Krafbands with Classic V-Belts are designed for extreme shock loads or large center distances in combination with small diameter pulleys and vertical shafts. Specs: Length In: 66 Width In: 0.66.', 'Optibelt 3/B66 KB Krafbands with Classic V-Belts are designed for extreme shock loads or large center distances in combination with small diameter pulleys and vertical shafts.', 'Optibelt 3/B66 KB Krafbands with Classic V-Belts are designed for extreme shock loads or large center distances in combination with small diameter pulleys and vertical shafts.', 'Optibelt 3/B66 KB Krafbands with Classic V-Belts are designed for extreme shock loads or large center distances in combination with small diameter pulleys and vertical shafts.', 'Section: B\nNumber Of Ribs: 3', 'Section: B\nNumber Of Ribs: 3', 'Length In: 66\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Length In: 66\nWidth In: 0.66', 0, 0, 83, 925, 33, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3_B66_Classical_Combo_V_Belt_-_Optibelt.png', '2026-01-21 10:01:23', '2026-01-21 10:01:23'),
(2022, '2C158 Bando Classical Combo V-Belt - Bando', '2C158 Bando Classical Combo V-Belt - Bando', 'Overview of 2C158 Bando Classical Combo V-Belt - Bando: Use 2C158 series of Classical Combo V-belts to resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves. The tie band assures lateral rigidity and guides the belts into the sheave grooves. Specs: Height In: 0.63 Width In: 0.88.', 'Use 2C158 series of Classical Combo V-belts to resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves. The tie band assures lateral rigidity and guides the belts into the sheave grooves.', 'Use 2C158 series of Classical Combo V-belts to resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves.', 'Use 2C158 series of Classical Combo V-belts to resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves.', 'Color: Black\nHeight Mm: 16\nWidth Mm: 50.8\nWeight Lbs: 9.164\nLength Mm: 4137.2', 'Color: Black\nHeight Mm: 16\nWidth Mm: 50.8\nWeight Lbs: 9.164\nLength Mm: 4137.2', 'Height In: 0.63\nWidth In: 0.88\nLength In: 158\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: C', 'Height In: 0.63\nWidth In: 0.88\nLength In: 158\nNumber Of Ribs: 2\nSection: C', 0, 0, 83, 925, 31, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/2C158_Bando_Classical_Combo_V-Belt_-_Bando.png', '2026-01-21 10:01:25', '2026-01-21 10:01:25'),
(2023, 'AX22 Classical Cogged V Belt - Mitsuboshi Belting', 'AX22 Classical Cogged V Belt - Mitsuboshi Belting', 'Overview of AX22 Classical Cogged V Belt - Mitsuboshi Belting: AX22 Classical Cogged V-belts feature improved transmission efficiency since they are composed of cord and rubber with side faces of fabric. They are used for agricultural machinery, blowers, dynamos and escalators. Specs: Section: AX.', 'AX22 Classical Cogged V-belts feature improved transmission efficiency since they are composed of cord and rubber with side faces of fabric. They are used for agricultural machinery, blowers, dynamos and escalators.', 'AX22 Classical Cogged V-belts feature improved transmission efficiency since they are composed of cord and rubber with side faces of fabric.', 'AX22 Classical Cogged V-belts feature improved transmission efficiency since they are composed of cord and rubber with side faces of fabric.', 'Width In: 0.5\nLength In: 22', 'Width In: 0.5\nLength In: 22', 'Section: AX', 'Section: AX', 0, 0, 83, 926, 32, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/AX22_Classical_Cogged_V_Belt_-_Mitsuboshi_Belting.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:14:52', '2026-01-22 01:14:52'),
