(2186, 'AX34 Classical Cogged V Belt - BESTORQ', 'AX34 Classical Cogged V Belt - BESTORQ', 'Overview of AX34 Classical Cogged V Belt - BESTORQ: AX34 Classical Cogged V-belts allow for higher load ratings than standard classical belts. The cogs are engineered to give the belts superior flexibility on both smaller and larger diameter pulleys. Specs: Length In: 34 Section: AX.', 'AX34 Classical Cogged V-belts allow for higher load ratings than standard classical belts. The lower section of the belt consists of an engineered synthetic fiber-reinforced rubber compound, which are made to be heat and oil resistant and provide excellent wear resistance, cool running and flexibility. The cogs are engineered to give the belts superior flexibility on both smaller and larger diameter pulleys.', 'AX34 Classical Cogged V-belts allow for higher load ratings than standard classical belts. The lower section of the belt consists of an engineered synthetic fiber-reinforced rubber compound, which are made to be heat and oil resistant and provide excellent wear resistance, cool running and flexibility.', 'AX34 Classical Cogged V-belts allow for higher load ratings than standard classical belts. The lower section of the belt consists of an engineered synthetic fiber-reinforced rubber compound, which are made to be heat and oil resistant and provide excellent wear resistance, cool running and flexibility.', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․34՛՛\nWidth In: 0.5', 'Angle: 40\nThickness: ․34՛՛\nWidth In: 0.5', 'Length In: 34\nSection: AX', 'Length In: 34\nSection: AX', 0, 0, 83, 926, 30, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/AX34_Classical_Cogged_V_Belt_-_BESTORQ.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:23:04', '2026-01-22 01:23:04'),
