(2336, 'BX45 Classical Cogged V Belt - Optibelt', 'BX45 Classical Cogged V Belt - Optibelt', 'Overview of BX45 Classical Cogged V Belt - Optibelt: Optibelt BX45 SUPER TX M=S V-Belts are designed to be used with extremely small pulley diameters. These classical cogged V-belts showcase their superiority in applications with extremely small pulley diameters, high rotational speeds, exceptionally high power requirements, and elevated ambient temperatures. Specs: Length In: 45 Width In: 0.66.', 'Optibelt BX45 SUPER TX M=S V-Belts are designed to be used with extremely small pulley diameters. Exceptional rubber formulations, combined with low-stretch tension cords, ensure both a substantial power transmission capacity and an extended operational lifespan. These classical cogged V-belts showcase their superiority in applications with extremely small pulley diameters, high rotational speeds, exceptionally high power requirements, and elevated ambient temperatures.', 'Optibelt BX45 SUPER TX M=S V-Belts are designed to be used with extremely small pulley diameters. Exceptional rubber formulations, combined with low-stretch tension cords, ensure both a substantial power transmission capacity and an extended operational lifespan.', 'Optibelt BX45 SUPER TX M=S V-Belts are designed to be used with extremely small pulley diameters. Exceptional rubber formulations, combined with low-stretch tension cords, ensure both a substantial power transmission capacity and an extended operational lifespan.', 'Weight Lbs: 0.2\nSection: BX', 'Weight Lbs: 0.2\nSection: BX', 'Length In: 45\nWidth In: 0.66', 'Length In: 45\nWidth In: 0.66', 0, 0, 83, 926, 33, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/BX45_Classical_Cogged_V_Belt_-_Optibelt.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:30:14', '2026-01-22 01:30:14'),
