(2467, '3V300 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando', '3V300 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando', 'Overview of 3V300 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando: 3V300 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts. You save belt, sheave weight, space and, of course, cost! Specs: Width In: 0.38 Height In: 0.32.', '3V300 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts. Its efficient design, executed with premium quality materials and advanced manufacturing techniques, can transmit up to 3 times higher horsepower than classical section belts in the same space or the same horsepower in 1/2 to 2/3 less space. You save belt, sheave weight, space and, of course, cost!', '3V300 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts.', '3V300 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts.', 'Color: Black\nWeight Lbs: 0.15\nWidth Mm: 9.7\nHeight Mm: 8.1\nLength Mm: 762', 'Color: Black\nWeight Lbs: 0.15\nWidth Mm: 9.7\nHeight Mm: 8.1\nLength Mm: 762', 'Width In: 0.38\nHeight In: 0.32\nLength In: 30\nSection: 3V', 'Width In: 0.38\nHeight In: 0.32\nLength In: 30\nSection: 3V', 0, 0, 83, 923, 31, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3V300_Bando_Narrow_V-Belt_-_Bando.png', '2026-01-22 01:46:29', '2026-01-22 01:46:29'),
(2468, '3V1180 Narrow Belt - BESTORQ', '3V1180 Narrow Belt - BESTORQ', 'Overview of 3V1180 Narrow Belt - BESTORQ: 3V1180 Narrow V-belts are recommended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The belts are manufactured to meet RMA standards for length and dimensions. Specs: Spacing: 0.41 Thickness: .40\'\'.', '3V1180 Narrow V-belts are recommended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The body rubber compound is a highly engineered synthetic rubber compound, specially compounded for cool running, flexibility, crack resistance, and excellent bonding to the outer fabric and tensile cords. The belts are manufactured to meet RMA standards for length and dimensions.', '3V1180 Narrow V-belts are recommended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The body rubber compound is a highly engineered synthetic rubber compound, specially compounded for cool running, flexibility, crack resistance, and excellent bonding to the outer fabric and tensile cords.', '3V1180 Narrow V-belts are recommended for high shock load and pulsating drives where extra stability is beneficial. The body rubber compound is a highly engineered synthetic rubber compound, specially compounded for cool running, flexibility, crack resistance, and excellent bonding to the outer fabric and tensile cords.', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 118\nHeight In: 0.32\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 118\nHeight In: 0.32\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Spacing: 0.41\nThickness: .40\'\'\nAngle: 40', 'Spacing: 0.41\nThickness: .40\'\'\nAngle: 40', 0, 0, 83, 923, 30, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3V1180_Narrow_Belt_-_BESTORQ.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:46:31', '2026-01-22 01:46:31'),
(2469, '3V1180 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt', '3V1180 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt', 'Overview of 3V1180 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt: Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1180 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. They can also substitute kraft bands for single wedge belts without altering the pulley geometry in case of unexpected belt vibration issues. Specs: Height In: 0.314 Weight Lbs: 0.2.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1180 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile. They can also substitute kraft bands for single wedge belts without altering the pulley geometry in case of unexpected belt vibration issues.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1180 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1180 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile.', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 118\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 118\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Height In: 0.314\nWeight Lbs: 0.2', 'Height In: 0.314\nWeight Lbs: 0.2', 0, 0, 83, 923, 33, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3V1180_SK_Narrow_V_Belt_-_Optibelt.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:46:34', '2026-01-22 01:46:34'),
