(2482, '3V250 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando', '3V250 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando', 'Overview of 3V250 Bando Narrow V-Belt - Bando: 3V250 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts. You save belt, sheave weight, space and, of course, cost! Specs: Width In: 0.38 Height In: 0.32.', '3V250 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts. Its efficient design, executed with premium quality materials and advanced manufacturing techniques, can transmit up to 3 times higher horsepower than classical section belts in the same space or the same horsepower in 1/2 to 2/3 less space. You save belt, sheave weight, space and, of course, cost!', '3V250 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts.', '3V250 Narrow V-belt is a narrow profile belt that transfers loads very efficiently and delivers higher horsepower ratings than classical section belts.', 'Color: Black\nWeight Lbs: 0.125\nWidth Mm: 9.7\nHeight Mm: 8.1\nLength Mm: 635', 'Color: Black\nWeight Lbs: 0.125\nWidth Mm: 9.7\nHeight Mm: 8.1\nLength Mm: 635', 'Width In: 0.38\nHeight In: 0.32\nLength In: 25\nSection: 3V', 'Width In: 0.38\nHeight In: 0.32\nLength In: 25\nSection: 3V', 0, 0, 83, 923, 31, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3V250_Bando_Narrow_V-Belt_-_Bando.png', '2026-01-22 01:47:10', '2026-01-22 01:47:10'),
