(2505, '3V1000 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt', '3V1000 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt', 'Overview of 3V1000 SK Narrow V Belt - Optibelt: Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1000 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. They can also substitute kraft bands for single wedge belts without altering the pulley geometry in case of unexpected belt vibration issues. Specs: Height In: 0.314 Weight Lbs: 0.2.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1000 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile. They can also substitute kraft bands for single wedge belts without altering the pulley geometry in case of unexpected belt vibration issues.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1000 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) 3V1000 Narrow V-Belts are engineered for heavy-duty drives such as mills or stone crushers. As these wedge v-belts transmit very high power levels, they can sometimes form a more compact drive than the SPC profile.', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 100\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Section: 3V\nLength In: 100\nWidth In: 0.38', 'Height In: 0.314\nWeight Lbs: 0.2', 'Height In: 0.314\nWeight Lbs: 0.2', 0, 0, 83, 923, 33, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/3V1000_SK_Narrow_V_Belt_-_Optibelt.jpg', '2026-01-22 01:48:14', '2026-01-22 01:48:14'),
