(3246, '10-8VK3350 - Aramid Narrow Combo V-Belt - Bando', '10-8VK3350 - Aramid Narrow Combo V-Belt - Bando', 'Overview of 10-8VK3350 - Aramid Narrow Combo V-Belt - Bando: 10-8VK3350 Aramid Narrow Combo V-belts are constructed with high modulus aramid cords to maintain length stability and to withstand severe shock loads, which are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch. To resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves, utilize Bando’s series of Combo belts. The tie band assures lateral rigidity and guides the belts into the sheave grooves. Specs: Height Mm: 24.9 Width In: 1.', '10-8VK3350 Aramid Narrow Combo V-belts are constructed with high modulus aramid cords to maintain length stability and to withstand severe shock loads, which are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch. The tensile cords of these belts make them ideally suitable for gas, oil, aggregate and lumber industry applications. The belts are unique due to their strength and resistance to heat. To resolve problem applications where belts are flipping over or jumping out of the sheaves, utilize Bando’s series of Combo belts. The tie band assures lateral rigidity and guides the belts into the sheave grooves.', '10-8VK3350 Aramid Narrow Combo V-belts are constructed with high modulus aramid cords to maintain length stability and to withstand severe shock loads, which are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch.', '10-8VK3350 Aramid Narrow Combo V-belts are constructed with high modulus aramid cords to maintain length stability and to withstand severe shock loads, which are specially engineered and twisted to provide maximum hp ratings with minimal stretch.', 'Color: Black\nCord: Aramid\nWeight Lbs: 129.109\nHeight In: 0.98\nLength Mm: 8534.4\nWidth Mm: 287', 'Color: Black\nCord: Aramid\nWeight Lbs: 129.109\nHeight In: 0.98\nLength M