(3453, 'SPA1757 SK Metric V Belt - Optibelt', 'SPA1757 SK Metric V Belt - Optibelt', 'Overview of SPA1757 SK Metric V Belt - Optibelt: Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) SPA1757 Metric V-Belts are engineered for all industrial applications from lightly loaded drives. The belt is coated with a durable rubber compound on its fabric cover, providing resistance to oil, extreme temperatures (both hot and cold), and the impacts of dust. Specs: Width Mm: 12.5 Height Mm: 10.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) SPA1757 Metric V-Belts are engineered for all industrial applications from lightly loaded drives. such as those for pumps, up to heavily loaded mills, and even stone crusher drives. The belt is coated with a durable rubber compound on its fabric cover, providing resistance to oil, extreme temperatures (both hot and cold), and the impacts of dust.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) SPA1757 Metric V-Belts are engineered for all industrial applications from lightly loaded drives. such as those for pumps, up to heavily loaded mills, and even stone crusher drives.', 'Optibelt S=C Plus (Set Constant) SPA1757 Metric V-Belts are engineered for all industrial applications from lightly loaded drives. such as those for pumps, up to heavily loaded mills, and even stone crusher drives.', 'Weight Lbs: 0.2\nSection: SPA\nLength Mm: 1757', 'Weight Lbs: 0.2\nSection: SPA\nLength Mm: 1757', 'Width Mm: 12.5\nHeight Mm: 10\nWeight Kg: 0.123', 'Width Mm: 12.5\nHeight Mm: 10\nWeight Kg: 0.123', 0, 0, 83, 921, 33, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/SPA1757_SK_Metric_V_Belt_-_Optibelt.png', '2026-01-22 02:40:19', '2026-01-22 02:40:19'),
