(3691, 'Carlisle 1626V293 Variable speed Cog Belt - Timken Belts', 'Carlisle 1626V293 Variable speed Cog Belt - Timken Belts', 'Overview of Carlisle 1626V293 Variable speed Cog Belt - Timken Belts: Timken 1626V293 Variable Speed Belts are designed for use with industrial variable speed pulleys to achieve a wide range of driven speeds. The EPDM material indicates exceptional flexibility and load-bearing capacity, offering a wide operational temperature range from -50°F to +250°F. Specs: Operating Temperature Range: -50 to 250°F Thickness In: 0.43.', 'Timken 1626V293 Variable Speed Belts are designed for use with industrial variable speed pulleys to achieve a wide range of driven speeds. The belts are made of Ethylene Propylene Diene Monomer (EPDM) that ensures high durability, and resistance to oil, heat, hardening, and glazing. The EPDM material indicates exceptional flexibility and load-bearing capacity, offering a wide operational temperature range from -50°F to +250°F.', 'Timken 1626V293 Variable Speed Belts are designed for use with industrial variable speed pulleys to achieve a wide range of driven speeds.', 'Timken 1626V293 Variable Speed Belts are designed for use with industrial variable speed pulleys to achieve a wide range of driven speeds.', 'Width In: 1.06\nMaterial: EPDM\nCord Material: Polyester\nColor: Black', 'Width In: 1.06\nMaterial: EPDM\nCord Material: Polyester\nColor: Black', 'Operating Temperature Range: -50 to 250°F\nThickness In: 0.43\n7: 65.17', 'Operating Temperature Range: -50 to 250°F\nThickness In: 0.43\n7: 65.17', 0, 0, 83, 919, 34, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/Carlisle_1626V293_Variable_speed_Cog_Belt_-_Timken_Belts.png', '2026-01-22 03:38:06', '2026-01-22 03:38:06'),
