(4181, 'Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord', 'Overview of Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly - Rexnord: The Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly is a reliable and durable solution for maintaining proper belt and chain tension in industrial applications. The clearance seal helps protect against contaminants, ensuring long-lasting performance. Ideal for demanding environments, this take-up assembly enhances operational efficiency and system longevity. Specs: Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT Locking Device Kit: SC3115.', 'The Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly is a reliable and durable solution for maintaining proper belt and chain tension in industrial applications. It features a 1 15/16\" mounted spherical roller bearing and a center pull, side-mounted design for easy installation and adjustment. Equipped with an eccentric cam locking collar, this assembly provides a secure and self-tightening grip on the shaft, minimizing slippage. The clearance seal helps protect against contaminants, ensuring long-lasting performance. Ideal for demanding environments, this take-up assembly enhances operational efficiency and system longevity.', 'The Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly is a reliable and durable solution for maintaining proper belt and chain tension in industrial applications.', 'The Rexnord ZAT631159 Take-up Assembly is a reliable and durable solution for maintaining proper belt and chain tension in industrial applications.', 'Model: ZAT3000\nHousing Material: Cast Iron\nHousing Style: Take-Up Assembly\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nBore Diameter: 1.9375 in\nCage Material: Engineered Polymer', 'Model: ZAT3000\nHousing Material: Cast Iron\nHousing Style: Take-Up Assembly\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nBore Diameter: 1.9375 in\nCage Material: Engineered Polymer', 'Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT\nLocking Device Kit: SC3115\nEnd Cap: DTC612\nMaximum Speed: 4050 rpm\nNet Weight Kg: 27.1 lbs\nSize Code: 6', 'Grease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT\nLocking Device Kit: SC3115\nEnd Cap: DTC612\nMaximum Speed: 4050 rpm\nNet Weight Kg: 27.1 lbs\nSize Code: 6', 0, 0, 81, 740, 28, 1, 0, 'storage/images/products/Rexnord_ZAT631159_Take-up_Assembly_-_Rexnord.jpg', '2026-01-22 07:42:00', '2026-01-22 07:42:00'),
