(4502, 'Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Blocks - Rexnord', 'Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Blocks - Rexnord', 'Overview of Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Blocks - Rexnord: The Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Block is a durable and reliable bearing unit designed for demanding industrial applications. It features a 2 7/16\" bore diameter and a mounted spherical roller bearing, housed in a fixed cast iron top angle protected screw take-up block for superior strength and stability. Additionally, this model includes one closed auxiliary cap, offering extra shielding for enhanced durability in harsh operating environments. Specs: Model: ZN2000 Length: 6.88 in.', 'The Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Block is a durable and reliable bearing unit designed for demanding industrial applications. It features a 2 7/16\" bore diameter and a mounted spherical roller bearing, housed in a fixed cast iron top angle protected screw take-up block for superior strength and stability. The single setscrew locking collar ensures a secure fit, while the clearance seal provides protection against contaminants. Additionally, this model includes one closed auxiliary cap, offering extra shielding for enhanced durability in harsh operating environments.', 'The Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Block is a durable and reliable bearing unit designed for demanding industrial applications. It features a 2 7/16\" bore diameter and a mounted spherical roller bearing, housed in a fixed cast iron top angle protected screw take-up block for superior strength and stability.', 'The Rexnord ZN82207B Take-up Block is a durable and reliable bearing unit designed for demanding industrial applications. It features a 2 7/16\" bore diameter and a mounted spherical roller bearing, housed in a fixed cast iron top angle protected screw take-up block for superior strength and stability.', 'Height: 9.75 in\nGrease Fitting Thread Size: 1/8 NPT\nCage Material: Engineered Polymer\nBore Diameter: 2.4375 in\nRadial Clearance: C3 STANDARD\nHousing Style: Take-Up Bloc